This product includes software derived from the following projects.

1. dsh-split-pane 0.1.0 (https://github.com/rainfd/dsh-split-pane, commit 6b4f9ca),
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-split-pane contributors.
   `bundles/split/src/layout/tree.ts` and `bundles/split/src/client/focus.ts` are
   adapted from it.

2. herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache License 2.0.
   Layout fitting, divider fitting and restore behaviour were rewritten from it;
   no herdr code is included.

3. ThinkRail (https://github.com/JetBrains/thinkrail), baseline commit 3bee4f1,
   Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 JetBrains s.r.o.
   Parts of the component kit in `packages/ui` are adapted from it; the files were
