   not used to identify this product.

4. DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1 (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/dsh), MIT License,
   Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek.
   The bundles are written against its public plugin APIs; small typed adapters
   mirror declarations from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-*` packages.

